  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.vessels.hint": "Drums, columns, adsorbers and cyclones",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.heat": "Heat",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.heat.hint": "Heat transfer: exchangers, reboilers, air coolers and fired heaters",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.machines": "Machines",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.machines.hint": "Pumps, compressors, ejectors and steam turbines",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.reactors": "Reactors",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.reactors.hint": "Stirred, trickle-bed and ebullated-bed reactors, the FCC converter and the delayed coker",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.solid_fuel": "Solid fuel",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.category.solid_fuel.hint": "Boilers and gasifiers for coal, biomass or waste",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.compressor.short": "Piston compressor",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.stirred_reactor": "Stirred tank reactor",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.stirred_reactor.hint": "A jacketed reactor with a top-mounted agitator drive, hung from lugs on its operating deck: charge and vapour on the top head, product through the bottom valve, coolant in and out of the jacket",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.adsorber": "Adsorber set",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.adsorber.hint": "1 to 4 temperature-swing adsorber beds on skirts, joined by valved headers top and bottom: feed in and product out while the other beds regenerate on hot gas",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.trickle_bed_reactor": "Trickle-bed reactor",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.trickle_bed_reactor.hint": "A heavy-wall hydroprocessing reactor of 1 to 4 catalyst beds on a skirt: oil and hydrogen down from the top elbow, cold hydrogen quench between the beds, effluent out through the skirt",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.ebullated_bed_reactor": "Ebullated-bed reactor",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.ebullated_bed_reactor.hint": "A residue hydrocracker whose catalyst bed is kept expanded by the ebullating pump under its bottom head, recycling liquid from above the bed; fresh catalyst added on top and spent catalyst drawn off on line",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.centrifugal_compressor": "Centrifugal compressor",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.centrifugal_compressor.hint": "A horizontally split multistage compressor (API 617) driven by a motor through a step-up gear on a concrete table: suction and discharge down through the table, the lube-oil console at grade",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.steam_turbine": "Back-pressure steam turbine",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.steam_turbine.hint": "A turbine-generator set on its plinth: steam in through the trip-and-throttle valve, exhaust up into a lower-pressure header, a gear and a generator",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.condensing_turbine": "Condensing steam turbine",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.condensing_turbine.hint": "A turbine-generator set on a concrete table, its exhaust falling into the surface condenser underneath: steam in, cooling water through the condenser, condensate and air extraction out",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.cyclone": "Cyclone separator",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.cyclone.hint": "1 to 4 high-efficiency cyclones in parallel on a frame: dusty gas in through the side inlet, clean gas out of the top, solids down through a rotary airlock",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fcc_converter": "FCC reactor and regenerator",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fcc_converter.hint": "A side-by-side fluid catalytic cracker in its structure: feed injected into the riser, the reactor and stripper on top of it, the regenerator burning the coke off in air, the two joined by slide-valved standpipes",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.delayed_coker": "Delayed coker drums",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.delayed_coker.hint": "1 or 2 pairs of coke drums on a concrete table with their structure and cutting derricks: one drum fills with hot residue while its partner is steamed, quenched and its coke cut out by water jets",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fluidized_bed_boiler": "Circulating fluidized-bed boiler",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fluidized_bed_boiler.hint": "A boiler burning solid fuel in a fast-fluidized bed, the solids caught in hot cyclones and returned to the furnace: feedwater in, steam out, ash drained below, the flue gas to its own stack",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fluidized_bed_gasifier": "Fluidized-bed gasifier",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fluidized_bed_gasifier.hint": "A pressurised refractory-lined gasifier (HTW type): solid fuel through lock hoppers into a bubbling bed blown with oxygen or air and steam, the syngas cleaned in a cyclone and cooled in a steam-raising cooler",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.grate_boiler": "Grate-fired boiler",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.grate_boiler.hint": "A stoker boiler burning solid fuel on a moving grate: fuel fed from day bins across its front, ash dropped into a drag-chain trough, feedwater in and steam out, the flue gas to its own stack",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fixed_bed_gasifier": "Fixed-bed gasifier",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.fixed_bed_gasifier.hint": "A Lurgi dry-bottom gasifier in its gasifier house: lump coal through the coal lock on top, oxygen and steam up through the turning grate, ash out through the ash lock, the raw gas washed in its wash cooler",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.stirred_reactor.short": "Stirred reactor",
  "gui.createcheme.equipment_constructor.equipment.adsorber.short": "Adsorber",
